gametitle=Madden NFL 2004 (SLUS-20752) [14F8B841]
comment=P10 -- drive from state-32's ai_think, the genuinely per-frame host. Over P1+P4.
// P9 starved at 5 frames/play and lane 1 found why: its sweep hook sits inside
// 0x001F1C20's KIND-4-ONLY filter (bne at 0x001F1C98), so 5 frames was exactly
// the blocker's kind-4 residency. Not a mystery -- an unseen gate.
//
// P10 hooks state-32's ai_think (0x001E8088) at 0x001E80C0, reached through a
// GATE-FREE per-player dispatcher: frame loop 0x00103A88 -> sim 0x00154660 ->
// 0x001540D8 -> 0x00154178 -> gameplay tick 0x00164EC0 -> dispatcher
// 0x001AF9D0 -> jalr [0x00527238 + state*24 + 8]. Every link single-caller or
// table-verified; no cadence divider anywhere. Both members of the pair hold
// ai_state 32 during the capture, verified live in two savestates.
//
// s0 is this pair member; gate dt_role==2 fires once per pair per frame from
// the defender's own think. a0 is restored to 1 before returning (the
// displaced sb runs first). Facing untouched: no warps, no spin.
// Step stays a flat 0.045 yd/f DIAGNOSTIC -- the question is still whether a
// position write survives 5/6, not what magnitude is right. The weight+STR
// law (D=2.42 here) layers on once frames exist.
// Canary 0x00514974: P9 scored 14 over 3 runs. Expect ~110 (37 capture frames
// x 3) if the host ticks as derived.

